@startuml
title Enigma — Challenge Lifecycle State Machine
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #1A73E8
  FontSize 14
  AttributeFontSize 12
}
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Announced : admin publishes
Draft --> [*] : cancelled
Announced --> Live : start_at reached\n(server clock)
Live --> Ending : end_at reached\n(submissions close atomically)
Ending --> Archived : grace window ends
Archived --> [*]
note right of Announced
  Pre-join / registration open.
  Posts GATED (thread read-only).
end note
note bottom of Live
  Posts + check-ins OPEN.
  Countdown live. Voting enabled.
end note
note right of Ending
  Configurable grace period
  (e.g. 24h) for final proofs.
end note
note left of Archived
  Read-only "proof wall":
  results, stats, badges.
end note
@enduml
